<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVAN 28-, 91-DAY T-BILLS STEADY.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVAN 28-, 91-DAY T-BILLS STEADY.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on</p>
<p>Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills was 30.69 percent on Tuesday,</p>
<p>unchanged from the previous auction on March 11, a National</p>
<p>Bank official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills also remained steady at 30.19</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    March 18	   March 11</p>
<p> Issue volume		    3.00 mln lei     2.00 mln lei</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		  4.09 mln	   1.33 mln</p>
<p> Volume sold		     2.5 mln	    1.2 mln</p>
<p> Yield			    30.69 pct	  30.69 pct</p>
<p> Price			    97.7 pct	   97.7 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  97.7-98.3 pct    97.7-98.7 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 Apr 17, 1997     Apr 10, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>				    March 18	   March 11</p>
<p> Issue volume		   18.00 mln	  25.00 mln</p>
<p> Denominations		   1,000 lei	  1,000 lei</p>
<p> Nominal demand		 14.36 mln	  17.53 mln</p>
<p> Volume sold		    13.8 mln	   16.4 mln</p>
<p> Yield			    30.19 pct	  30.19 pct</p>
<p> Price			    93.0 pct	   93.0 pct</p>
<p> Range of bids		  93.0-94.5 pct    93.0-94.0 pct</p>
<p> Maturity			 June 19, 1997    June 12, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 REUTER</p>
